&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 62px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 14px"&gt;https://www.shimz.co.jp/company/csr/environment/tcfd/&lt;/span&gt;
